# This repo is authored on Windows and deployed to Ubuntu. A CRLF shebang makes
# the kernel look for a binary literally named "bash\r" and the script dies with
# "command not found" — or, worse, `set -euo pipefail` becomes an invalid option
# name and the script runs on WITHOUT strict mode.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.conf    text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer   text eol=lf
*.ts      text eol=lf
*.tsx     text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.css     text eol=lf
